From abe708324bb02adcba1a195a71830d38033080b1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AzediZ <145237384+AzediZ@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 20:05:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 90/91] Bombs fire and explode

Bomb launchers took no target, so the launcher found nothing to shoot
at and stopped. They now launch the bomb along the ship's velocity, the
way destiny sends a missile whose target is its own launcher. The bomb
flies for its flight time and goes off whether or not the bomber is
still there.

Everything within the explosion range takes the blast, friend or foe,
reduced only by signature radius. Lockbreaker bombs also break locks
against the target's sensor strength, and Void bombs drain 1800 GJ.
A bomb caught in another bomb's blast takes it on its armour, so bombs
of a different kind destroy each other and the same kind barely touch.
Ballistic control systems don't add to bomb damage.
